{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1383860-tell-me-the-best-repercussions-you-ve-suffered-for-breaking-an-eclipse-oath","id":1383860,"title":"Tell me the best repercussions you've suffered for breaking an eclipse oath!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-25T16:15:40-07:00","id":1383860,"title":"Tell me the best repercussions you've suffered for breaking an eclipse oath!","content":"<span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">What oaths have you (seen) broken, and how did Heaven exact it's wrath?</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-25T22:13:04-07:00","id":1383908,"title":"","content":"You know, it\u2019s funny - I\u2019ve played for years and years now, but I\u2019ve never played a character who broke an Eclipse oath, nor even played one who <i>witnessed</i> a broken oath.<br /> <br /> The first game I played, an Eclipse PC swore an oath to assist a circle of Infernals in excavating a First Age city for a fraction of the artifacts scavenged. Our Zenith murdered the Eclipse when the Infernal circle\u2019s Slayer tried to hold him hostage, so we never saw the oath broken.<br /> <br /> My own Infernals game had its Fiend thinking he could use his anima power to safely suspend an Eclipse\u2019s oath he\u2019d made, but when he learned the Eclipse\u2019s Essence was too high for it, he just decided to toe the line.<br /> <br /> In the round-robin game I joined, Knight Raiton used his anima power to ensure a terrible fate would befall a child abuser if he ever hit his kid again\u2026 but we haven\u2019t been back that way to see if anything came of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-26-2020, 01:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-26T00:43:42-07:00","id":1383921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1383860-tell-me-the-best-repercussions-you-ve-suffered-for-breaking-an-eclipse-oath?p=1383908#post1383908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the round-robin game I joined, Knight Raiton used his anima power to ensure a terrible fate would befall a child abuser if he ever hit his kid again\u2026 but we haven\u2019t been back that way to see if anything came of it.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is another Eclipse Oath with an NPC Solar and our night caste to attempt to reverse a curse of a Raksha on the NPC's daughter in a peaceful fashion. That one will sadly almost certainly be broken since ,unknown to either party, the daughter soul was accidentally scattered into a wyld pocket. And once the NPC finds out they will almost certainly attempt to kill our Night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14713-chronos12","name":"Chronos12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14713_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T18:10:52-07:00","id":1384535,"title":"","content":"I have rarely if ever seen an Eclipse player bind someone to an Oath... Let alone have that NPC later break it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T13:17:50-07:00","id":1385128,"title":"","content":"I've only played Eclipse Solars, &amp; I've only performed 1 oath in game.<br /> <br /> The oath involved an election, of all things, in a small town near the Wyld. An Abyssal wanted to be the leader of the town &amp; turn it into a place the dead could co-habitat with the living. In exchange, they could help the living fight back against the Wyld. The Abyssal asked for the election &amp; my Solar got her to agree to play fair &amp; not use any magic to influence the voting. The Abyssal won the vote fairly &amp; turned out to be genuine in her motives. Our Circle had to leave to go on other quests &amp; didn't get to go back &amp; see how the town was doing.<br /> <br /> Now, the Eclipse PC's did use the Oath to add weight to negotiations. It was amusing how well it worked as a soft threat. I think I got a lot of mileage out of it that way.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4428,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","user":"Daredevil","date":". 05-01-2020, 04:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T19:10:29-07:00","id":1385172,"title":"","content":"I was in a 2e game before 3e dropped. Our eclipse got super drunk (in real life). He made eclipse oaths with everyone. Including Scarlet whisper (hence a weird number) He broke every oath. Our ST had a thing of holding off botches and sometimes doing the turbo botch. Well the turbo botch never happened. (17 botches) <br /> <br /> We saved it for a realm game at the end. Set it up as a big scene, this dread anathema had built up an army to challenge the new Emperor. The circle prepared their armies. It was sudden. A huge sky fleet. I had them join war. Then the front ship leaned, and crashed the whole thing the whole fleet just exploding in a light show. I had made the villain of that sudden threat that eclipse. It was an anti climax of that game meant to be a fun joke after the actual last real session (which was taking over the imperial manse). It was actually me convincing them to get together and have beer and pizza while we then discussed our next game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}